  "details": "I was in same invite+ world with my friend and i noticed, that if i look at his profile in \"online friends\" or \"favorite friends\", i can request on him, even if i was in same world. On \"In room\" tab was showing, that he in this world and on profile there was saying \"online in same world\", but on \"Online friends\" and \"Favorite\", it was showing \"online in private world\" and reqest button was avalible. If i send request to them, they get this reqest and can accept. If they invite me and i accept invite, i just join same world.",
